JobL:Database_architects rdfs:subClassOf JobL:Job .
JobL:Editors rdfs:subClassOf JobL:Job .
JobL:Exercise_Trainers_and_Group_Fitness_Instructors rdfs:subClassOf JobL:Job .
JobL:Fast_food_and_Counter_workers rdfs:subClassOf JobL:Job .
